  "title": "Earthquake, Thailand, 28 March 2025 (EQ20250328THA)",
  "description": "UNOSAT geodata for Earthquake, Thailand, 28 March 2025 (EQ20250328THA), from 1 dataset on the Humanitarian Data Exchange. HDX describes the event:\n\n**UNOSAT code: EQ20250328THA, GDACS ID: 1474477**  This map shows no visible damage based on a very high resolution satellite image collected 29 March 2025 when compared to very high resolution satellite imagery from 1 February 2025. The USGS shake map indicates the intensity of the earthquake measured 5.0 in this area.\nThis is a preliminary analysis and has not yet been validated in the field. Please send ground feedback to the United Nations Satellite Centre (UNOSAT).\n\nHDX datasets:\n\n- [Satellite-detected Damage the UNESCO Tentative List component Chiang Mai as of 29 March 2025](https://data.humdata.org/dataset/damage-the-unesco-tentative-list-component-chiang-mai-as-of-29-march-2025)\n\nRead [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for how the collections were built.",
